## Model Strategy

| Role          | Model  | Rationale                                              |
|---------------|--------|--------------------------------------------------------|
| Lead          | opus   | Orchestration, decomposition, and coordination         |
| PM            | opus   | Requirements elicitation and edge-case analysis        |
| Architect     | opus   | System design, tradeoff evaluation, ADRs               |
| Dev           | sonnet | Implementation is high-volume, well-scoped by stories  |
| QA            | sonnet | Test validation is pattern-matching against criteria   |
| Code Reviewer | opus   | Cross-cutting review needs architectural context       |

